Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Preserve capable dispatcher verdicts in pool wait
 notices

Carry newest capable ready-episode verdict when machine placement omits skip; preserve busy/update precedence. Recorded pacing uses governor pools or recorded providers and renders llm_paced.

Proof: 284 notice/backlog tests pass; nine condition mutants killed. Authorized acceptance correction: only the obsolete capable llm_paced test assertion now expects preserved pacing instead of UNKNOWN.
